The tarantool module talks to a Tarantool database over its own binary
protocol and exposes it as a REST or JSON-RPC endpoint.  nginx translates
between JSON on the HTTP side and msgpack on the database side, so a
stored procedure can be called without a layer in between, and the spaces
and indexes a client may name can be restricted by configuration.

This port only installs the module sources.  The module itself is built by
the nginx ports when their HTTP_TARANTOOL option is enabled.
